undergraduate medical students in Uganda: a need assessment survey. J Med Educ Curric Dev [Internet]. [cited 2024 Feb 27];11:23821205231222988. Available from: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38204974/ . Accessed Feb 2024 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] 18. Finley CR, Chan DS, Garrison S, Korownyk C, Kolber MR, Campbell S et al (2018) What are the most common conditions in primary care? Syst Rev Can Fam Physician 64(11):832–840 [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 19. Haas R, Gorelik A, Busija L, O’Connor D, Pearce C, Mazza D et al (2023) Prevalence and characteristics of musculoskeletal complaints in primary care: an analysis from the population level and analysis reporting (POLAR) database. BMC primary care 24(1):40 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 20. Pinney SJ, Regan WD (2001) Educating medical students about musculoskeletal problems. Are community needs reflected in the curricula of Canadian medical schools? J Bone Joint Surg Am 83(9):1317–20 [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 21. Rouhani M, Gelder C, Selwyn-Gotha J, Rufai S (2017) Which factors influence the pursuit of a career in surgery? A national undergraduate survey. [Internet]. [cited 2023 Jul 22];23(12):581–7. 10.12968/bjhc.2017.23.12.581 22. Barber S, Brettell R, Perera-Salazar R, Greenhalgh T, Harrington R (2018) UK medical students’ attitudes towards their future careers and general practice: a cross-sectional survey and qualitative analysis of an Oxford cohort. BMC Med Educ [Internet]. [cited 2023 Jul 22];18(1). Available from: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29973203/ . Accessed Feb 2024 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] 23. UK Specialty Training Competition Ratios [Internet]. [cited 2024 Feb 27]. Available from: https://www.specialty-applications.co.uk/competition-ratios/#google_vignette . Accessed Feb 2024 Associated Data This section collects any data citations, data availability statements, or supplementary materials included in this article. Sup